video_desc":"优等生林微被偏心父母强行转去最差八班，只为省钱供弟弟读书。班里全是旁人眼中不学无术的富家少年校霸程砚、玩世不恭的周游、直率泼辣的夏小棠。本以为等待她的是排挤霸凌，却意外收获独一份的偏爱。少年们用别扭又真诚的方式护着她，默默支撑她的升学梦。","series_id":"7668961158434409534","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"20261106235627750FD263F40206929CE5\",\"rank\":\"3\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7668961158434409534\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"normalized_duration\\\":1.2216413021087646,\\\"finish\\\":0.05665243789553642,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.03843981772661209,\\\"collect\\\":0.05921025201678276,\\\"like\\\":0.08882028609514236,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.4127728939056396,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.26086559891700745}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7668961158434409534","play_cnt":3767971,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"景阅文化","sub_title":"青春·青春成长","score":"8.2","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":62,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5023,\"name\":\"青春\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5023&categoryName=青春&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5080,\"name\":\"青春成长\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5080&categoryName=青春成长&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5178,\"name\":\"逆风翻盘\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5178&categoryName=逆风翻盘&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5104,\"name\":\"日久生情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5104&categoryName=日久生情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5260,\"name\":\"大女主\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5260&categoryName=大女主&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5284,\"name\":\"学神\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5284&categoryName=学神&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5336,\"name\":\"极品亲戚\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662: